    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Angelo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115510136014415475783/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLAbPUkGkUaJhYFos8jmJxfr9_4kkSQbS_SzbQ1ZGsvTW1yyg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "We looked at other places for our kitchen reno and then I was recommended by a co-worker about this place, have to say I felt comfortable dealing with them since it was a big expense for us. Sebastien was great, gave us suggestions and was patient with us, since we went through 7 updates from the original design. Matthew came and took the measurements,  gave me some great suggestions about the cabinets and we made the last changes. The date finally came cabinets delivered the day before, and next day bright and early the installer was at the house. All the cabinets with done in one day and the ogies and final stuff were done day after. I have to say the installer's work was amazing, the kitchen is just beautiful compared to what we had before, so much more storage. Guys I cannot thank you enough for the great work that was done.",
        "time": 1595263327,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Raymond Singh",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108830698711594684092/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgbYpcvGWneK3bOGPfjQKnJRqd-lzmov1d_f-oBc9KppbqFGRR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Worked with them on my home in Vaudreui-Dorion were awesome to deal with beginning to end! They spent hours designing every aspect of our kitchen and office area with us and after sales service was excellent, when something needed to be adjusted, fixed or changed they were available and came by to take care of it within a few days.",
        "time": 1535743236,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Charlotte",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110256621780747755395/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI7FKpDx8WJ6SAGEyYR0-EVkZ4XFSA0dGksLji7Irxss-ix1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I submitted a request to have custom cabinetry made for my walk-in pantry back in March 2021. Having not gotten a response back from them via email, I went directly to their showroom for a follow-up. The man who greeted me there, the designer Sébastien, looked bothered by my presence and didn't show much interest in trying to help. I asked for an update on my request and he said he had all of my information and would get back to me in June, with a possible delivery and installation in September 2021. I left the showroom waiting for his call.\n\nWe're now nearing September and Sébastien never called back and never followed through. What a waste of time. From March to September I got nothing from them. They'll blame Covid for the delays, but in my opinion it's more a lack of common courtesy.",
        "time": 1629209607,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Azeen Haji",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112500342212693217170/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXvsD5tbqi2_BiMjT4Gi9Ccq80CHe-c5Sn_9suFgJ1zHqPT5kBCXA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "We had an amazing experience from our appointment to post-appointment service. Melanie was very helpful and patient. Thank you so much Melanie!",
        "time": 1631807835,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "J MatZ",
